@page "/world"
@attribute [Authorize(Policy = AdministratorAccounts.Policy)]
<PageTitle>World · Eden</PageTitle>
<h1>Wipe world</h1>
<p>This permanently removes every character, player bot, ship, item, corporation, alliance, structure,
    market order, wallet, industry job and other saved gameplay state, including mod world state.</p>
<p>Accounts, passwords, account roles and clone grades remain. Server configuration, installed mods,
    catalog data and administrator access remain.</p>
<p>The server disconnects players and stops cleanly, saves the latest world, then creates and verifies
    a backup before deleting anything. If shutdown or backup fails, the wipe does not proceed.</p>
<p class="error">The server stays stopped afterward. Wait for the console to report completion before restarting it.
    Restart creates fresh NPC populations and market supply according to your settings. Players create new characters.</p>
<form method="post" action="/api/admin/world/wipe">
    <AntiforgeryToken />
    <label>Type WIPE WORLD to confirm <input name="confirmation" autocomplete="off" required pattern="WIPE WORLD" /></label>
    <button type="submit">Back up, wipe world and stop server</button>
</form>
